The description states "'The Belt and Road Initiative' is one of several strategies promoted by China to achieve the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation."
This indicates that "the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation" is the *goal*, and "The Belt and Road Initiative" is a *means* or *strategy* to achieve that goal.
Typically, means *push* goals. So, "The Belt and Road Initiative" (Movement) would PUSH "the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation" (Document).
